  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC phase-out management plan (stage II) in Botswana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC phase-out management plan (stage II, first tranche) in Botswana. The complete HCFC phase-out is to be completed by 2030. With UNIDO#s support, capacity-building and recovery initiatives are being implemented to promote low-GWP alternatives and improve servicing sector practices.</narrative>
  </description>
